      "id": "CLEAN_GAP_BW:chkain_kain_bounded_portion",
      "decision": "approve_source_bound_card",
      "reason": "The source contrasts a bounded usable work object with AIIN prescribed measure. Preserve that contrast; measured portion is not automatically the same semantic contract, while the event count three is not a numeral meaning.",
